WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:03.250
Insisting they belong to a fourth class,

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:07.460
the "Fourth" is a group that resorts to
indiscriminate acts of terror to attain their ends.

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:13.580
They were attempting to spread a sketchy drug
called "monstrine" throughout the city of Libelle.

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:13.170
<b><i>Invoke</i></b>

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:13.580
<b><i>[Flameshot]</i></b>

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:17.210
<b><i>Barrier</i></b>

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:22.670
Sent by Pastor Sicilia from the church,
Momo and I started to investigate the drug.

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:26.250
Momo accidentally encountered Princess Ashuna,

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:29.000
who provided information on
the monstrine's production facility.

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:36.290
Meanwhile, I set out to investigate the figurehead
of the Fourth in the city, Manon Libelle,

00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:40.080
and infiltrated an evening ball hosted by her.

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:44.380
But somehow,
I ended up having to bring this nuisance along.

00:00:56.830 --> 00:00:58.380
Good evening!

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:01.460
I'm a pure, just, and strong priestess!

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:03.630
Enjoying yourselves?

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:06.130
Look, I'm a pure, just, and strong priestess!

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:08.330
Blessings to the both of you!

00:01:11.290 --> 00:01:15.170
Akari, didn't I tell you not to stand out too much?

00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:17.670
What? I'm not standing out!

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:18.960
It's a party.

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:22.540
I have to at least introduce myself to the
people I don't know or I'll seem odd!

00:01:22.670 --> 00:01:23.790
Oh, honestly.

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:27.580
Even if someone talks to you,
you can't wander off with them, okay?

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:30.830
That, and don't have any of the food or drink!

00:01:30.830 --> 00:01:33.790
There's no knowing what kind of suspicious
drugs they might be laced with!

00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:37.290
I'm fine, you told me that like a hundred times!

00:01:37.290 --> 00:01:40.250
What do you take me for, Menou?

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:41.290
Let's see...

00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:44.580
I think you're an idiot with the brain of a ten-year-old.

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:48.000
That's not true!

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:52.920
A couple of elegant women just told me,
"My, what a lovely lady!" okay?!

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:55.040
That's me, a proper lady!

00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:58.460
That kind of thing really makes me worried.

00:02:00.130 --> 00:02:03.880
Still, I can't spend all my time worrying about Akari.

00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:09.170
Akari, I'm going to excuse myself for a bit.

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:11.920
Really? I'll be so lonely!

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:14.330
If you're a lady, you shouldn't whine.

00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:16.250
Anyway, wait for me like a good girl.

00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:23.460
No moon tonight.

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:26.710
No divine protection from Saint Marta, I guess.

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:04.830
<b>Episode 9: At the Evening Ball</b>

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:11.290
You there, stop.

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:14.170
I said stop!

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:16.210
What's a priestess like you doing here?!

00:04:19.630 --> 00:04:24.130
What a careless guard for a place
that produces monstrine.

00:04:26.540 --> 00:04:32.500
All right, let's get this over with and go
savor the sight of Menou in a dress!

00:04:43.080 --> 00:04:49.250
What I need to find is proof that Manon Libelle is involved
in the production and distribution of monstrine.

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:52.630
Indeed, the manner in which you
conceal your presence is impressive.

00:04:55.630 --> 00:05:01.130
Instead of hiding yourself,
you keep yourself inconspicuous in plain sight.

00:05:01.130 --> 00:05:04.830
It was so natural, even I almost failed to notice.

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:10.880
Who would have thought there would be another soul
attempting to infiltrate the castle during the ball?

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:13.290
Apparently Manon Libelle has plenty of enemies.

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:19.040
I'm a princess of the Grisarika Kingdom and
a knight in my own right, Ashuna Grisarika.

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:21.380
And who might you be?

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:26.420
One of my maids neglected her duties
to come meet with her lover.

00:05:26.420 --> 00:05:28.580
I'm simply here to admonish her.

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:30.920
Pretending to be the daughter of an aristocrat?

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:34.580
No lady of the Noblesse learns how to act in stealth.

00:05:34.920 --> 00:05:38.960
If so, it would mean Your Highness couldn't
be a lady of the Noblesse either,

00:05:38.960 --> 00:05:40.960
given that you detected me.

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:45.960
The Order of Knights is an exception.
Strength must be chosen over grace.

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:49.380
Could it be you're of a similar ilk?

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:52.210
Why not turn around and show your face?

00:05:53.210 --> 00:05:54.420
Of course.

00:05:57.830 --> 00:06:00.830
Too shy to show your face, hmm?

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:03.130
I simply know my place.

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:05.630
I beseech you to turn a blind eye.

00:06:08.710 --> 00:06:09.790
My apologies.

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:12.580
But, seeing a suspicious character
makes me want to cut them down.

00:06:12.790 --> 00:06:16.830
Besides, it's obvious from your
bearing that you're a skilled fighter.

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:20.670
I prefer to scrutinize how strong
a person is with my own eyes.

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:22.540
So you ask that I fight Your Highness.

00:06:22.790 --> 00:06:25.080
I'm glad you're quick on the uptake.

00:06:25.630 --> 00:06:27.250
I suppose I have no choice.

00:06:49.460 --> 00:06:50.670
Etheric guns.

00:06:51.130 --> 00:06:53.880
They're supposed to be taboo.

00:06:54.170 --> 00:06:58.290
The terrorists on the train had them, too.
Where are you getting these things?

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:02.290
S-stay away!

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:04.790
You were watching, weren't you?

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:09.960
A shot from that with your amount of
ether will just ricochet off of my barrier.

00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:15.000
Anyway, why don't you show me
where your transaction records are?

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:17.630
Oh, and tell me about the etheric
tool producing monstrine.

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:20.420
I'll record it in my scripture.

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:21.670
<b><i>Invoke</i></b>

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:22.580
<b><i>[Record]</i></b>

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:26.630
If you're caught lying...

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:29.500
You know what will happen, right?

00:07:34.130 --> 00:07:35.880
Not interested in a fight, eh?

00:07:35.880 --> 00:07:38.210
Well, I'm going to enjoy this either way!

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:39.580
<b><i>Invoke</i></b>

00:07:39.580 --> 00:07:41.000
<b><i>[Gale]</i></b>

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:44.920
Impressive judgement!

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:46.000
<b><i>Invoke</i></b>

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:46.630
<b><i>[Flameburst]</i></b>

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:47.130
<b><i>[Gale]</i></b>

00:07:52.170 --> 00:07:54.580
I thought I was faster but she anticipated it...?

00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:57.920
You're quite skilled at controlling ether.

00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:00.580
Then how about this?!

00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:13.080
From what I can tell,
this one doesn't have much etheric capacity.

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:20.960
This is no fun all alone.

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:23.670
How much longer is Menou going to be?

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:27.080
There!

00:08:28.380 --> 00:08:28.670
<b><i>[Gale]</i></b>

00:08:31.580 --> 00:08:32.080
<b><i>Invoke</i></b>

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:32.420
<b><i>[Bubble]</i></b>

00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:34.670
I sense magecraft being conjured! Something big!

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:39.960
Bubbles?!

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:52.040
She used the bubbles as a diversion
while manipulating her dagger at will...

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:54.580
What smooth etheric control!

00:08:56.580 --> 00:08:58.080
You got me!

00:08:58.080 --> 00:09:02.500
It's been ages since someone went
easy on me or outdid me like this.

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:04.000
I'm touched!

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:07.710
I'm generous about repaying favors.

00:09:07.710 --> 00:09:12.170
After all, I can't bear not seeing that face of yours,
whatever that might take!

00:09:14.290 --> 00:09:16.000
I can't compete with her technique.

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:19.330
So I'll win using my advantage.

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:18.460
<b><i>Double Invoke</i></b>

00:09:18.710 --> 00:09:19.330
<b><i>[Slash: Expansion, Flameburst]</i></b>

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:27.130
<b><i>Invoke</i></b>

00:09:27.130 --> 00:09:27.790
<b><i>[Gale]</i></b>

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:32.670
What was that?!

00:09:32.790 --> 00:09:35.210
What's going on? I see flames!

00:09:35.710 --> 00:09:37.500
That's the way Menou went.

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:41.920
She's okay... right? It's Menou.

00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:44.580
Yeah, she's got to be okay.

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:46.540
Menou!

00:10:00.040 --> 00:10:01.290
Well, she got me.

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:04.170
To think she would get the better of me so easily.

00:10:11.580 --> 00:10:14.580
Except for Menou, you can all just die!

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:17.750
Ah, so she's the one.

00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:21.250
That's good material I can use
for poking fun at Momo tonight.

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:26.330
Something's wrong. Something's definitely wrong.

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:32.000
The weird feeling I had back there is getting worse.

00:10:33.290 --> 00:10:36.250
I've regressed over and over again.

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:42.170
The only major thing that's ever happened in Libelle
was me getting sent into the Pandemonium.

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:44.170
But, this time...

00:10:44.170 --> 00:10:47.290
Too many things are happening
that have never happened before.

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:53.170
Getting assaulted in the market,
this ball being hosted, that pillar of fire...

00:10:53.540 --> 00:10:55.330
None of those have ever happened!

00:10:55.330 --> 00:10:56.710
Good evening.

00:10:58.460 --> 00:11:00.830
That was such a large pillar of fire.

00:11:00.830 --> 00:11:02.420
Not to worry, though.

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:07.540
Both of them seem rational so
I'm sure there won't be much damage.

00:11:09.710 --> 00:11:12.380
Oh, you must excuse my sudden appearance.

00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:15.040
My name is Manon Libelle.

00:11:15.380 --> 00:11:19.790
I do believe this is our first time meeting. Is that right?

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:22.290
This has never happened before, either...

00:11:22.830 --> 00:11:25.380
Her coming to talk to me...

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:45.080
Honestly, could she be any more of a nuisance?

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:47.790
She's every bit the battle freak she's rumored to be.

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:52.250
That scuffle must have put the Fourth on alert.

00:11:52.670 --> 00:11:55.880
It's a shame, but tonight's mission is over.

00:11:55.880 --> 00:11:58.000
I should meet up with Akari right away.

00:12:03.790 --> 00:12:06.710
Are you worried about who I am?

00:12:06.710 --> 00:12:11.460
Please don't be. I'm merely a proxy.

00:12:12.170 --> 00:12:13.580
It's just that...

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:16.290
I wanted a chance to meet with you briefly.

00:12:20.790 --> 00:12:26.130
My own mother had black hair just like yours.

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:33.830
I would appreciate if you could tell me about the
place where you were before coming here.

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:40.540
This person knows...
that I'm an otherworlder who came from Japan!

00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:43.170
Would you rather not?

00:12:43.750 --> 00:12:45.960
No, that's not it.

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:48.960
Sorry, I don't remember.

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:54.460
It's true. I've lost most of them.

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:57.250
The memories of my sixteen years in Japan.

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:01.040
Is that so...

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:02.460
I see.

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:06.210
That must mean you've also
used your powers quite heavily.

00:13:07.710 --> 00:13:09.920
I still envy you, though.

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:14.250
You have the thing that I long to have.

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:20.750
You possess the power to change the world...
as you see fit.

00:13:21.790 --> 00:13:23.580
Sorry to have bothered you.

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:30.210
If you manage to get out of this city,
I do hope you will be free to live as you choose.

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:34.500
Something is definitely wrong.

00:13:34.920 --> 00:13:37.330
With this many new things happening,

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:41.290
my advantage of knowing the
future won't matter anymore.

00:13:41.790 --> 00:13:45.790
But, I have to save Menou this time for sure!

00:13:46.330 --> 00:13:48.880
What to do? What to do? What to do?!

00:13:50.460 --> 00:13:52.380
Oh dear. What's wrong with her?

00:13:56.630 --> 00:14:01.710
No, calm down Akari.
Maybe this is a change for the better.

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:05.000
Either way, I need to figure out
what's causing these big changes.

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:06.290
To do that...

00:14:06.670 --> 00:14:09.710
I'll look into that person who
seemed to know something!

00:14:09.710 --> 00:14:11.580
For starters, at least.

00:14:12.210 --> 00:14:14.540
What was the deal with those flames?

00:14:15.130 --> 00:14:16.380
How scary!

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:19.790
Honestly. I told Akari to stay put!

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:21.040
Where did she go?

00:14:29.920 --> 00:14:35.380
According to the transaction records,
they started producing monstrine two weeks ago...

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:40.500
Manon Libelle, who had done nothing until that point,

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:44.500
suddenly took initiative and brought in
the etheric tool for producing monstrine.

00:14:44.790 --> 00:14:48.380
I wonder what could have happened two weeks ago?

00:14:56.460 --> 00:14:58.330
The way this room is constructed...

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:02.580
It's a typical ritual space based
on the concept of original sin.

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:05.670
Which would mean,
the center of the room should have a coffin-

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:09.540
That's not a coffin.

00:15:09.540 --> 00:15:11.080
An iron maiden?

00:15:11.380 --> 00:15:12.670
That's a torture device.

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:17.290
I smell blood.

00:15:20.170 --> 00:15:21.380
I see.

00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:24.130
So this is the etheric tool used to produce monstrine.

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:26.330
What nasty taste.

00:15:45.580 --> 00:15:48.460
They used... a child this little?

00:15:57.790 --> 00:16:00.330
She probably won't make it, but...

00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:04.500
<b><i>Invoke</i></b>

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:06.290
<b><i>[Explosion]</i></b>

00:16:11.500 --> 00:16:12.420
<b><i>Barrier</i></b>

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:17.500
A conditional spell that activates
not when you open the iron maiden,

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:19.170
but only when you try to save the child...

00:16:20.170 --> 00:16:22.040
Even worse, these spikes...

00:16:22.210 --> 00:16:23.670
Damn this thing!

00:16:32.710 --> 00:16:34.670
Poison on the spikes?

00:16:35.380 --> 00:16:40.040
Seriously, whoever set that up has
a horribly twisted personality!

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:44.420
Have to at least...

00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:45.670
<b><i>Communication</i></b>

00:16:45.710 --> 00:16:48.000
contact... Me... nou...

00:16:49.210 --> 00:16:52.380
With Miss Manon Libelle? Are you sure?

00:16:52.500 --> 00:16:55.500
You mean that cute young priestess from before, right?

00:16:55.500 --> 00:16:56.830
They were talking together.

00:16:56.830 --> 00:16:57.500
Weren't they?

00:16:57.500 --> 00:17:01.130
But, it didn't look like it was a very lively conversation.

00:17:01.210 --> 00:17:04.750
Is it possible she was taken somewhere by Miss Manon?

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:07.330
It didn't seem that way. Right?

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:09.960
Yes. Once she was alone, she said,

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:12.540
"What to do? What to do?"
and was making quite a fuss.

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:13.380
That's right.

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:15.580
Then she wasn't kidnapped?
She was a cute girl but seemed a little "eccentric," don't you think?<b></b>

00:17:15.580 --> 00:17:16.040
She was a cute girl but seemed a little "eccentric," don't you think?

00:17:16.040 --> 00:17:17.540
Then where...?
She was a cute girl but seemed a little "eccentric," don't you think?<b></b>

00:17:20.580 --> 00:17:21.750
Momo?!

00:17:22.880 --> 00:17:24.540
Oh, I see.

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:26.880
That trap was activated?

00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:35.290
I think it's finally going to come.
The day I get my revenge.

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:37.790
Isn't that right, Mother?

00:17:52.290 --> 00:17:53.380
Me...nou...?

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:55.540
You don't have to talk, Momo.

00:17:55.540 --> 00:18:00.290
I know everything that happened from the
recordings you sent from your scripture.

00:18:00.790 --> 00:18:02.960
I'm... sorry...

00:18:03.420 --> 00:18:06.460
There was a child... and I let my guard down...

00:18:07.670 --> 00:18:10.420
You did a wonderful job, Momo.

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:13.000
I'm so proud to have you as my aide.

00:18:14.040 --> 00:18:15.630
Take your time and rest up.

00:18:15.630 --> 00:18:18.750
Don't worry. Leave the rest up to me.

00:18:19.670 --> 00:18:20.960
Okay...

00:18:22.710 --> 00:18:26.130
They've done it now, those Fourth bastards!

00:18:26.380 --> 00:18:29.790
It was very strong poison and
she's not in good condition.

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:35.580
But the spread of the poison is slow,
perhaps thanks to her inherent reserve of ether.

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:37.460
I believe we can help her.

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:38.540
I understand.

00:18:38.540 --> 00:18:43.000
I'm grateful for your swift and pertinent response,
Pastor Sicilia.

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:45.130
No need to be grateful.

00:18:45.130 --> 00:18:48.210
Providing protection to priestesses
is the duty of the Faust.

00:18:48.880 --> 00:18:50.420
And what of Ms. Akari?

00:18:50.540 --> 00:18:52.250
I failed to find her.

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:55.710
It seems most likely that curiosity
tempted her to explore the castle,

00:18:55.710 --> 00:18:58.330
where she must have gotten lost.

00:18:58.580 --> 00:19:01.330
Either that or the Fourth have her.

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:04.500
They didn't seem to have any interest in Akari...

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:06.920
But of course that is a possibility.

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:11.790
As such, Pastor Sicilia,
can I ask you to close off Libelle Castle?

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:19.290
Momo's video recording has made it clear that
the Fourth are involved in the production of monstrine.

00:19:19.580 --> 00:19:23.500
Let us completely weed out the Fourth based in Libelle.

00:19:23.830 --> 00:19:28.540
I will invade the castle and capture
Manon Libelle and the leading members.

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:30.460
And recover Akari, of course.

00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:34.130
Could I ask you to negotiate for the
Order of Knights to cooperate?

00:19:38.920 --> 00:19:40.710
I'm surprised.

00:19:40.710 --> 00:19:45.080
You rely on others, unlike Flare.

00:19:46.290 --> 00:19:49.080
You're familiar with my Master, Pastor Sicilia?

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:54.540
She told me once to my face...
that I was useless.

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:58.080
I've met you before as well...

00:19:58.670 --> 00:20:01.380
But of course you wouldn't remember.

00:20:01.750 --> 00:20:06.290
By the way, Ms. Menou. Didn't you suspect me at all?

00:20:06.580 --> 00:20:10.380
That I might have a hand in what's going on?

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:15.920
It would be a lie to say I never suspected you.

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:19.460
Especially since it's right after what
happened with Archbishop Orwell.

00:20:19.830 --> 00:20:20.880
However...

00:20:21.420 --> 00:20:25.880
I'm proposing this plan because I've determined
that you're trustworthy based on our interactions.

00:20:26.250 --> 00:20:29.330
Pastor Sicilia, please give me the help I need!

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:34.460
Very well.

00:20:38.540 --> 00:20:41.000
I shall go negotiate with the Order of Knights.

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:45.250
Libelle Island has been sequestered as of noon today!

00:20:45.380 --> 00:20:50.250
All Fourth lurking on the island will be arrested
for the production and distribution of monstrine!

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:53.790
All who wish to plead guilty must surrender immediately!

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:54.920
I repeat!

00:20:55.290 --> 00:20:58.960
Libelle Island has been sequestered as of noon today!

00:20:58.960 --> 00:21:02.130
All Fourth lurking on the island will be arrested
for the production and distribution of monstrine!

00:21:02.210 --> 00:21:05.170
Wh-who thought they would act so quickly?!

00:21:05.170 --> 00:21:06.170
What do we do?!

00:21:06.170 --> 00:21:09.790
C-calm yourself. They haven't arrested us yet!

00:21:10.000 --> 00:21:11.040
You are completely surrounded.

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:12.710
This is unfortunate...
You are completely surrounded.<b></b>

00:21:12.710 --> 00:21:13.080
Do not resist and surrender immediately!

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:15.250
Perhaps I should make sure
Do not resist and surrender immediately!<b></b>

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:18.000
the members won't talk, for starters.

