Oh?

00:21:22.830 --> 00:21:25.330
Did somebody touch this?

00:21:28.630 --> 00:21:32.630
I'm sorry to keep you waiting.
Let us discuss how to counter-

00:21:32.630 --> 00:21:33.580
Oh?

00:21:43.670 --> 00:21:47.630
My, it's amazing that you can do such a thing.

00:21:47.630 --> 00:21:52.000
Perhaps it was you who snuck into my room as well?

00:21:52.130 --> 00:21:54.040
Yup, that's right.

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:56.630
Hello again, Miss Manon.

00:21:56.960 --> 00:22:00.960
I want to ask you a few things, but do you mind?

00:22:01.290 --> 00:22:04.290
